{"id":"091259c83b563d39","group":"58","path":"58/batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md","title":"ZFC Tree Height","display":"df-zfc-tree-height — ZFC Tree Height","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-tree-height","aliases":["58-df-zfc-tree-height"],"display":"df-zfc-tree-height — ZFC Tree Height","depends_on":["[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-tree-height"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-tree-height</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-tree-height — ZFC Tree Height"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md\">../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,R,\\kappa\\in V\">\\(T,R,\\kappa\\in V\\)</span> (tree carrier, reflexive tree order, and candidate height)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\">\\(\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\)</span> (tree predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"f06e57c5c0b1354d\" href=\"?note=f06e57c5c0b1354d\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-tree.md\">../batch18/58-df-tree.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Ordinal}\">\\(\\mathrm{Ordinal}\\)</span> (ordinal predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"5582a281f15a33c2\" href=\"?note=5582a281f15a33c2\" title=\"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md\">../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Bijective}\">\\(\\mathrm{Bijective}\\)</span> (bijection predicate, see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"d583890235faf0d5\" href=\"?note=d583890235faf0d5\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md\">../batch18/58-df-bijective.md</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}\">\\(P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}\\)</span> (strict predecessor set)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\">\\(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\)</span> abbreviates the displayed order-isomorphism formula below</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S\\subseteq V^3\">\\(\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S\\subseteq V^3\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}height\\text{-}level\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nt\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P_t,\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in P_t\\;\n(x\\neq y\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}height\\text{-}level\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\nt\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P_t,\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in P_t\\;\n(x\\neq y\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}height}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\n\\land(\\beta\\in\\alpha\\lor\\beta=\\alpha)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}height}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&amp;\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&amp;\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\n\\land(\\beta\\in\\alpha\\lor\\beta=\\alpha)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The order-isomorphism uses the strict part of the reflexive tree order; without <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\neq y\">\\(x\\neq y\\)</span>, reflexivity would contradict the irreflexivity of ordinal membership.</li>\n<li>The two bounded clauses say respectively that <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span> strictly bounds every node level and that no smaller ordinal does.</li>\n<li>Hence the empty tree has height <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"0\">\\(0\\)</span>, while a nonempty tree has height <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup\\{\\alpha+1:T_\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\\}\">\\(\\sup\\{\\alpha+1:T_\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\\}\\)</span>, without using an unregistered level or supremum operator.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch02/58-ax-zfc.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-tree.md","status":"resolved","id":"f06e57c5c0b1354d","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)$ (tree predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-tree.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md","status":"resolved","id":"5582a281f15a33c2","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Ordinal}$ (ordinal predicate, see [[../batch17/58-df-ordinal.md]])","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-bijective.md","status":"resolved","id":"d583890235faf0d5","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{Bijective}$ (bijection predicate, see [[../batch18/58-df-bijective.md]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,R,\\kappa\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Ordinal}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Bijective}","display":false},{"tex":"P_t\\coloneqq\\{s\\in T:\\langle s,t\\rangle\\in R\\land s\\neq t\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S\\subseteq V^3","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}height\\text{-}level\\text{-}ordinal}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\nt\\in T\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\alpha)\\land\n\\exists f\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mathrm{Bijective}(f,P_t,\\alpha)\n\\land\\forall x,y\\in P_t\\;\n(x\\neq y\\land\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in R\\leftrightarrow f(x)\\in f(y))\n\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}tree\\text{-}height}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,R,\\kappa)\\\\\n\\leftrightarrow{}&\n\\mathrm{Tree}(T,R)\\land\\mathrm{Ordinal}(\\kappa)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\\\\\n&\\land\\forall\\beta\\in\\kappa\\;\\exists t\\in T\\;\\exists\\alpha\\in\\kappa\\;\n\\Bigl(\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)\n\\land(\\beta\\in\\alpha\\lor\\beta=\\alpha)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"x\\neq y","display":false},{"tex":"\\kappa","display":false},{"tex":"0","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup\\{\\alpha+1:T_\\alpha\\neq\\varnothing\\}","display":false}],"bytes":2266,"backlinks":[{"id":"7914c15bd7cca3e8","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S$ (exact tree-height predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])"},{"id":"47ecd1e17d0a4400","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S(T,<_T,\\omega_1)$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])"},{"id":"da9a67159229ab9c","anchor":"ref-5","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])"},{"id":"0f49f8a86fc4b13b","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":3,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (level predicate from [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])"},{"id":"c7287f9e62abafc5","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\operatorname{LevOrd}_{T,R}(t,\\alpha)$ is the level-ordinal relation from [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]"},{"id":"a8519e320aac8e03","anchor":"ref-12","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S$ (tree-height predicate, see [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]])"},{"id":"74ece9d458e22000","anchor":"ref-3","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{TreeHeight}_S$（规范树高谓词，见 [[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md]]）"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-3754","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch01/58-df-zfc-tree-height.md|58-df-zfc-tree-height]]（batch01）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","f06e57c5c0b1354d","5582a281f15a33c2","d583890235faf0d5"]}